    "updated_at": "2021-09-12T12:32:39Z",
    "body": "it could be an option, but I'm not sure what is the use case, it what situation that option is desirable.\r\nI mean, as a shop owner, you normally want customers to order as many products as possible, you normally don't want to confuse customers and make it difficult for them to complete an order by emptying their shopping basket without warning.",
